/* 大世界街巷与荒野随机奇遇库 / 17处核心街巷奇遇与场景池路由 / 零模板句 */

:: MP World Deep Router [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>>
<<set _allWorldScenes to ["MP World Event Loose Cobble", "MP World Event Curio Peddler", "MP World Event Smuggler Drop", "MP World Event Driftwood Chest", "MP World Event Forest Shrine", "MP World Event Park Sketchbook", "MP World Event Temple Censer", "MP World Event Sewer Cache", "MP World Event Barb Patrol", "MP World Event Danube Carriage", "MP World Event School Corridor", "MP World Event Pool Steam", "MP World Event Arcade Neon", "MP World Event Shopping Mirror", "MP World Event Hospital Night", "MP World Event Brothel Backdoor", "MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 0", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 1", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 2", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 3", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 4", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 5", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 6", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 7", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 8", "MP World Bank 2 Scene 9", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 0", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 1", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 2", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 3", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 4", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 5", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 6", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 7", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 8", "MP World Bank 3 Scene 9", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 0", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 1", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 2", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 3", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 4", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 5", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 6", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 7", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 8", "MP World Bank 4 Scene 9"]>>
<<set _pool to _allWorldScenes.filter(function (n) { return !$mpSeenScenes[n]; })>>
<<if _pool.length is 0>>
	<<set _pool to _allWorldScenes>>
	<<set $mpSeenScenes to {}>>
<</if>>
<<set _pick to _pool.random()>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes[_pick] to 1>>
<<include _pick>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble [nobr]
<<effects>>
你在走过宅邸街拐角时，脚下一块松动的青石板微微下陷了半寸。石板边缘的青苔被人用铁器刮开过，露出一道新近刻下的三角暗记。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[上前仔细查探 (0:06)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[记下位置继续赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "Domus Street")]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Domus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Domus Street">>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Loose_Cobble")>>
	你蹲在墙根阴影里掀开那块松动的青石板，在下方干燥的砖槽里摸到了一只用油布裹紧的早年怀表壳与几枚旧银币。
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
	<<skulduggery 3>><<stress -4>>
<<else>>
	石板下的砖槽已经被你取空，只剩下几枚散落的便士硬币。
	<<money 220>><<stress -2>>
<</if>>
<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你屏息仔细摸索。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[顺势在附近暗处再搜寻一番 (0:05)|MP World Deep Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[整理衣襟返回街面 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler [nobr]
<<effects>>
高街廊檐下的流动旧货摊前，一名披着灰斗篷的货郎正低头擦拭着几只沾满铜绿的航海罗盘与发条匣。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[上前仔细查探 (0:06)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[记下位置继续赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

